We, at Coforge, are committed to become “Carbon Neutral in our operations by 2050”. In line with this commitment,
• Procure 10% of electricity from green sources by 2027 and increase the share to ~50% by 2040. Transition
to 100% renewable energy by 2050 by committing to the RE100 initiative.
• Increase share of electric vehicles (EVs) in fleet for employee commute to 10% by 2030 and to 50% by 2045.
